# Line-ending policy: LF in the repository and on checkout. Same policy as
# half-built-robots-blog, half-built-ui and the-bead-reserve-monorepo, so
# Windows tooling cannot scatter CRLF into the masters or dist/ (every
# consumer vendors dist/ byte for byte).

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets, never normalized. SVG stays text: it is XML, and LF keeps
# the vendored copies identical across platforms.
*.png   binary
*.ico   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
